WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
[Upbeat music]

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.926
Meet iROAR Premium.
Clemson’s iROAR, upgraded.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.756
It turns the cluttered portal into one clean dashboard,
with every campus service a search away.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:18.878
Planning next semester? Look up any class
by course code, title or CRN.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:25.353
Every section shows its professor’s Rate My Professors
rating, difficulty and would-take-again score.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.287
Sort to find the best fit.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.936
Open a section to see how that professor
has graded the course before.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.542
Add sections to preview your week,

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.768
and catch time conflicts before you register.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.923
iROAR Premium.
Free on the Chrome Web Store.
